1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:03,050
(Raj:)I say you tell Alex your heart
belongs to Penny.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,440
(Raj:)I provide her a shoulder to cry on,
then roughly half a year later...

3
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:07,850
(Raj:)...I give it to her good.

4
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:15,480
(Sheldon:)I want to thank you all for coming on such
short notice. In the past...

5
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:18,530
(Sheldon:)...I've reached out to each of you
individually...

6
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:24,010
(Sheldon:)...but I believe my present situation
requires the collective wisdom of the group.

7
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:29,000
(Sheldon:)Which, as you can see from
your commemorative t-shirts, I've dubbed...

8
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:33,130
(Sheldon:)...Sheldon Cooper's Council of Ladies.

9
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:37,050
(Penny:)What is happening?

10
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:42,050
(Sheldon:)I need your advice about a delicate
workplace situation.

11
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:45,730
(Sheldon:)To protect those involved,
I'll be changing their names.

12
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,210
(Bernadette:)Who's involved?

13
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:50,250
(Sheldon:)A short, bespectacled colleague of mine...

14
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:54,200
(Sheldon:)...who lives in the shadow
of his brilliant roommate.

15
00:00:54,440 --> 00:01:00,020
Uh... Let's call this colleague
Ricardo Shilly-Shally.

